  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x12c",
   "off": 300,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■幼少期\n\n幼いころの記憶が無い。\n\n背中に大きなケガを負い、\n川岸でたおれているところを\n当時少女であった乙女に\n助けられる。\n数日生死の境を\nさまよったらしい。\n\nその後、坂本家の子として\n育てられる。",
   "en": "[Childhood]\\n\\nHas no memory of his early\\nyears.\\n\\nFound collapsed on a\\nriverbank, his back badly\\nwounded, he was saved by\\nOtome, then a young girl.\\nHe hovered near death for\\ndays.\\n\\nHe was then raised as a\\nson of the Sakamoto\\nfamily."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x230",
   "off": 560,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "幼少期",
   "en": "Childhood"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x254",
   "off": 596,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "しばらくし、父と母が\n亡くなる。\n龍馬の歌を喜んで\n聞いてくれていた\n記憶だけが強く残る。",
   "en": "Some time later, his\\nfather and mother passed\\naway. All that stays vivid\\nis the memory of them\\nhappily listening to\\nRyoma's songs."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x358",
   "off": 856,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "少年期",
   "en": "Adolescence"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x37c",
   "off": 892,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■少年期\n\n身分の差が激しい土佐で、\n自分を育ててくれた乙女を\n守れるように\n剣術を習い始める。\n\n自分の好きな歌をうたうと、\nへたくそとバカにされる\n毎日だったが、逆に歌も剣術も\n一番になってやると決意する。",
   "en": "[Adolescence]\\n\\nIn Tosa, where class lines\\nran deep, he took up the\\nsword to protect Otome,\\nwho raised him.\\n\\nMocked every day as a\\nlousy singer when he sang\\nthe songs he loved, he\\nvowed to be the best at\\nboth singing and the\\nsword."
  },
