  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x914",
   "off": 2324,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■幼少期\n\n桂と出会う。\nしばらく女の子だと\nおもっていた。\n後に後悔することになる…。\n\n桂と祭りに行き、\n「きんぎょすくい」を\n「金魚救い」と勘違いして\n出店の店員と揉める。",
   "en": "[Childhood]\\n\\nMet Katsura. For a while\\nhe thought Katsura was a\\ngirl. He would come to\\nregret it...\\n\\nAt a festival with\\nKatsura, he took \"goldfish\\nscooping\" for \"goldfish\\nrescuing\" and got into a\\nfight with the stall\\nkeeper."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0xa18",
   "off": 2584,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "少年期",
   "en": "Adolescence"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0xa3c",
   "off": 2620,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■少年期\n\n松下村塾に入塾。\n\n松陰と出会い、ロックを知る。\n『男とロック』の講義中、\n男ならいかなる時でも\nすずしい顔をせよ！\nと松陰に唐辛子を\n食べさせられた。\n\nそこから訓練を重ね、\n今では好物に。\n\nこの頃から\nロックへのめり込む。",
   "en": "[Adolescence]\\n\\nEntered Shoka Sonjuku,\\nmet Shoin, found rock.\\nIn a lecture on 'Men and\\nRock,' Shoin made him eat\\nchili peppers: \"A man\\nkeeps a cool face!\"\\n\\nAfter much training,\\nthey're now his favorite\\nfood.\\n\\nSince then, he's lived\\nfor rock."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0xb40",
   "off": 2880,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "青年期",
   "en": "Young Adulthood"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0xb64",
   "off": 2916,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■青年期\n\n幼い頃から\n面倒を見てくれていた\n家令をなくす。\n徳川派遣の視察と\n高杉が揉めた\n責任を負ったのが原因。\n\nこの頃から、幕府に対して\n嫌悪と警戒心を強める。",
   "en": "[Young Adulthood]\\n\\nLost the steward who had\\nlooked after him since he\\nwas little. The steward\\ntook the blame for\\nTakasugi's clash with an\\ninspector sent by the\\nTokugawa.\\n\\nFrom then on, his hatred\\nand wariness of the\\nshogunate grew."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0xc68",
   "off": 3176,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "現在",
   "en": "Present"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0xc8c",
   "off": 3212,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "当時の流行病にかかり\nしばらく臥せる。\n家令がなくなった直後で、\n高杉の高齢の祖父母に\n伝染ると悪いと\n桂が看病する。\n\n■現在\n\n藩政にかかわることを\nのぞまれるも、\n幕府のやり方に反発し、\n松陰を捜す旅に出る。",
   "en": "Bedridden a while with the\\nepidemic of the day. With\\nthe steward gone, Katsura\\nnursed him so Takasugi's\\nold grandparents wouldn't\\ncatch it.\\n\\n[Present]\\n\\nExpected to serve his\\ndomain, he defies the\\nshogunate and sets out\\nto find Shoin."
  },
