  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x10d8",
   "off": 4312,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "幼少期",
   "en": "Childhood"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x10fc",
   "off": 4348,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■幼少期\n\n高杉と出会う。\n\n祭りで見た海外の楽器が\nどういう仕組なのか気になり\n大人に聞いて回るが誰も\n答えられなかったところ、\n分解してみてみれば？と\n高杉にいわれたことから、\nモノの構造に興味を持つ。",
   "en": "[Childhood]\\n\\nMet Takasugi.\\n\\nCurious how a foreign\\ninstrument at a festival\\nworked, he asked adults,\\nbut no one knew. Takasugi\\nsaid, \"Why not take it\\napart?\" and he grew\\nfascinated by how things\\nare built."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x1200",
   "off": 4608,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "少年期",
   "en": "Adolescence"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x1224",
   "off": 4644,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "この頃から発明にハマりだす。\n色々なものを拾っては\n合体する日々。\n\n楽器に興味を持ったことから、\n様々な楽器を習う。\n\n■少年期\n\n松下村塾に入塾。\n\n女の子に間違えられる\n容姿だったため\n自分を恥じ、家出する。",
   "en": "Around this time he got\\nhooked on inventing,\\npicking things up and\\ncombining them.\\n\\nDrawn to instruments, he\\nlearned many kinds.\\n\\n[Adolescence]\\n\\nEntered Shoka Sonjuku.\\n\\nAshamed of being mistaken\\nfor a girl, he ran away\\nfrom home."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x1328",
   "off": 4904,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "青年期",
   "en": "Young Adulthood"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x134c",
   "off": 4940,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "桂家では大騒ぎになったが、\n高杉により発見される。\n\n■青年期\n\n諸藩へ遊学。\n長崎へ遊学した際、\nエレキテルと出会い、\n発明に磨きがかかる。",
   "en": "The Katsura household was\\nin an uproar, but Takasugi\\nfound him.\\n\\n[Young Adulthood]\\n\\nStudied in various\\ndomains. In Nagasaki he\\ndiscovered the elekiter,\\nand his inventing took\\noff."
  },
  {
