  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x18e4",
   "off": 6372,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■幼少期\n\n豪農の子であったが、\n両親が侍に殺され\n孤児となってしまう。\n近藤の家の道場に\n引き取られて育つ。\n\nこの頃から近藤に隠れ\n親の仇を捜し始める。\n\n荒れていたため\nバラガキと呼ばれる。",
   "en": "[Childhood]\\n\\nBorn to a wealthy farming\\nfamily, he was orphaned\\nwhen samurai killed his\\nparents, and raised at the\\nKondo family's dojo.\\n\\nHe began hunting his\\nparents' killer behind\\nKondo's back.\\n\\nSo wild he was called the\\nThorny Brat."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x19e8",
   "off": 6632,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "少年期",
   "en": "Adolescence"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x1a0c",
   "off": 6668,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■少年期\n\n新選組の前身、\n壬生組が結成される。",
   "en": "[Adolescence]\\n\\nThe Mibu-gumi, forerunner\\nof the Shinsengumi, was\\nformed."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x1b10",
   "off": 6928,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "青年期",
   "en": "Young Adulthood"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x1b34",
   "off": 6964,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■青年期\n\n新選組が愛獲として、\n正式デビューが決定。",
   "en": "[Young Adulthood]\\n\\nThe Shinsengumi were set to\\nmake their official idol\\ndebut."
  },
  {
