  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x20cc",
   "off": 8396,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■幼少期\n\n生まれなど不明。\n生きるためいくつかの\n盗賊団などを\n転々としていたようである。",
   "en": "[Childhood]\\n\\nOrigins unknown. To\\nsurvive, he seems to have\\ndrifted from one band of\\nthieves to another."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x21d0",
   "off": 8656,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "少年期",
   "en": "Adolescence"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x21f4",
   "off": 8692,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■少年期\n\n新選組の前身、\n壬生組が結成される。\n\n近藤にスタミナをつけるため、\nにんにくを食べろといわれるが\n全く受け付けない。\n影で吸血鬼と呼ばれていた。",
   "en": "[Adolescence]\\n\\nThe Mibu-gumi, forerunner\\nof the Shinsengumi, was\\nformed.\\n\\nTold by Kondo to eat\\ngarlic for stamina, he\\ncouldn't stomach it.\\nBehind his back, he was\\ncalled a vampire."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x22f8",
   "off": 8952,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "青年期",
   "en": "Young Adulthood"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x231c",
   "off": 8988,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■青年期\n\nオーディションで選ばれた\n新選組１期生。\n\n新選組が愛獲として、\n正式デビューが決定。\n\n煌の間でも人気は急上昇。\n一番隊組長となる。",
   "en": "[Young Adulthood]\\n\\nA first-generation\\nShinsengumi member, chosen\\nby audition.\\n\\nThe Shinsengumi's official\\nidol debut was set.\\n\\nSoaring in popularity with\\nfans, he became\\nFirst Unit Captain."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x2420",
   "off": 9248,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "現在",
   "en": "Present"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x2444",
   "off": 9284,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■現在\n\n土方と人気を二分し、\nセンタートップを務めている。\n\nステージで各地を回る際、\n温泉めぐりを楽しみに\nしている。",
   "en": "[Present]\\n\\nSplitting the fans evenly\\nwith Hijikata, he holds\\nthe top center spot.\\n\\nOn tour, he looks forward\\nto visiting hot springs."
  },
