   "jp": "幼少期",
   "en": "Childhood"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x28b4",
   "off": 10420,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■幼少期\n\n全てができてしまう\n子供だった。\n\n母を亡くし、父の手で\n育つことになる。\nこの頃から女性がそばに\nいると機嫌が良い子であった。\n\n海軍提督である父の影響か、\nいつかは自分も世界へと\n思うようになる。",
   "en": "[Childhood]\\n\\nA child who could do\\nanything.\\n\\nAfter losing his mother,\\nhe was raised by his\\nfather. Women nearby\\nalways put him in a good\\nmood.\\n\\nHis father being a navy\\ncommodore, he dreamed of\\ntaking on the world one\\nday."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x29b8",
   "off": 10680,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "少年期",
   "en": "Adolescence"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x29dc",
   "off": 10716,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■少年期\n\n自分は世界にこそふさわしい。\n世界の女性を自分の物に\nするため、\n海軍に入る決意をする。\n\nかなりの数の女性と\n付き合っており、\n元彼から喧嘩を\nふっかけられる日々を過ごす。",
   "en": "[Adolescence]\\n\\n\"I was made for the\\nworld.\" Resolved to join\\nthe navy to win the\\nworld's women.\\n\\nDated a great many women\\nand spent his days\\nfending off their angry\\nexes."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x2ae0",
   "off": 10976,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "青年期",
   "en": "Young Adulthood"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x2b04",
   "off": 11012,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■青年期\n\n海軍に入隊。\n頭角を顕し、階級を上げていく。\nしばしば海外への遠征隊に\n出かけ、武勲を上げる。\n\nロックフェスにて、ある男から\n人生で初めての敗北を味わう。\n以来、本気でロックに\n取り組む。\n\n海外基地でのコンサートにて、\nセッションに入ったJと出会う。",
   "en": "[Young Adulthood]\\n\\nJoined the navy and rose\\nfast, winning honors on\\noverseas missions.\\n\\nAt a rock fest, a certain\\nman handed him his first\\ndefeat. He has taken rock\\nseriously ever since.\\n\\nMet J at a base concert,\\nwhen J joined the session."
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x2c08",
   "off": 11272,
   "max": 32,
   "kind": "bio-title",
   "jp": "現在",
   "en": "Present"
  },
  {
   "id": "ui_profile:0x2c2c",
   "off": 11308,
   "max": 256,
   "kind": "bio",
   "jp": "■現在\n\n合衆国の政策、つまり\nワールドツアー中。\n\n各地で超魂を奪い、\n属国化している。",
   "en": "[Present]\\n\\nPursuing U.S. policy -- in\\nother words, on a world\\ntour.\\n\\nStealing the Ultra Soul of\\nevery land, he makes them\\nvassal states."
  },
